gnome-service-manager (0.3.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add an optional Command Line column for running services.
  * Add an Ubuntu app launcher that can be pinned to the GNOME dock.
  * Request administrator authentication when launched from a regular
    user session. The graphical interface stays in the user's session.
  * Document how to uninstall the Debian package.

